/P 74 0 R
/E (To recover it, Zenith's black-ops division activated RUNNER-4, a compact infiltration unit built for stealth, precision, and split-second decisions. Its mission: slip past the vault's defenses, recover the scattered data cores, and extract before the countdown hits zero. Across 4 covert operations, RUNNER-4 will face a grid-locked server floor, a breached security corridor, a blocked maintenance tunnel, and a final encrypted sorting gate; one misstep, and the mission goes dark for good.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
